Z||000000||theogre||12-24-2001||09:05 AM||||Could some one post the complete line of text from a GT tail light assemblly? <P>This text is found on the clear cover of the taillight, usually along the bottom or top edge. You don't have to open the trunk or anything else to find it.<P>The line I'm after will have the abreviation SAE and/or DOT in it.<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Dan010||12-24-2001||09:32 AM||||DOT (2)1(2)R(2)S(2)T 86 GUIDE 2P2<P>S cound be a 5 not sure, same on both sides<P>Merry Christmas and a Great New Year!!!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Sage||12-24-2001||10:01 AM||||Just for verification I got exactly the same thing on mine and it IS an"S":<P>DOT (2)1(2)R(2)S(2)T 86 GUIDE 2P2<P>PEACE<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||12-24-2001||10:42 AM||||Thanks guys.||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||12-24-2001||04:20 PM||||Interesting..... I wanted the above info so I could decode the functions assigned to the light assembly.... <P>(2)R is odd.... That one is the backup light... The code says there are 2 per assembly but the wiring diagram only shows one each....<P>(2)I = 2 turn<BR>(2)R = 2 reverse<BR>(2)S = 2 stop<BR>(2)T = 2 tail<P>btw A coupe is<P>DOT (2)IR(2)S(3)T 84 GUIDE 2P<P>(2)I = 2 turn<BR>R = 1 reverse<BR>(2)S = 2 stop<BR>(3)T = 3 tail<P>Guide is the Guide Division of GM that I think may now part of Delphi. <BR>||||reg||3
